!! Sample content

This wiki contains example recipes and ingredients, each marked with a `demo: yes` field.  They show off the conventions and give you something to read while you get oriented.  When you're ready to start your own, [[Remove sample content|$:/community/recipes/ui/RemoveDemoContent]] lets you pick which categories, recipes, and ingredients to keep and which to remove.

