!! Empty Edition

This empty edition does not include any sample recipes or ingredients.  If you would like to add some for reference, you can download them from [[the community editions site|https://recipes.community.example.com/sample-data.json]] and drag the resulting file onto this wiki.


<%endif%>

!! Getting started

Use the "New Recipe" button  ( {{$:/community/recipes/ui/Buttons/new-recipe}} -- in the page toolbar on the right)<%if [field:demo[yes]] %> or clone an existing demo one<% endif %> to create your first recipe.  The template prefills the conventional sections, so you can focus on the content.

